WEBVTT

00:00:58.496 --> 00:01:01.079
you're being defensive,
stop being defensive,

00:01:01.079 --> 00:01:04.246
just listen to what I have to say.
But I didn't say anything.

00:01:04.538 --> 00:01:06.871
And the conversation continued
and it continued.

00:01:07.246 --> 00:01:11.663
And the tenseness in my body
grew grew even tighter.

00:01:12.204 --> 00:01:15.329
And I thought to myself, wait a minute,
I'm angry and frustrated.

00:01:15.454 --> 00:01:17.996
These emotions matter. I
need to see something.

00:01:17.996 --> 00:01:21.079
I need to say something right now.
And so I did.

00:01:21.704 --> 00:01:25.163
And as I was saying it, the
tears started flowing.

00:01:26.204 --> 00:01:29.996
Typically, I would beat myself up about
not having emotional control

00:01:29.996 --> 00:01:32.496
or expressing my emotions inappropriately
by crying,